+/**
+*  Set "CropBox" entry to the page dictionary.
+* @param[in] page   - Handle to a page.
+* @param[in] left   - The left of the rectangle.
+* @param[in] bottom - The bottom of the rectangle.
+* @param[in] right  - The right of the rectangle.
