+  /* <Title>                                                               */
+  /*    Computations                                                       */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Abstract>                                                            */
+  /*    Crunching fixed numbers and vectors.                               */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Description>                                                         */
+  /*    This section contains various functions used to perform            */
+  /*    computations on 16.16 fixed-float numbers or 2d vectors.           */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Order>                                                               */
+  /*    FT_MulDiv                                                          */
+  /*    FT_MulFix                                                          */
