+  /*************************************************************************/
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Struct>                                                              */
+  /*    FTC_SBitRec                                                        */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Description>                                                         */
+  /*    A very compact structure used to describe a small glyph bitmap.    */
