+  /*  imposing                                                           */
+  /*                                                                     */
+  /*    (a + b) / 2 <= sqrt(X - c/2)    ,                                */
+  /*                                                                     */
+  /*  where X = 2^32 - 1, the maximum unsigned 32-bit value, and using   */
+  /*  unsigned arithmetic.  Now we replace `sqrt' with a linear function */
+  /*  that is smaller or equal for all values of c in the interval       */
